# Cloudflare Pages redirects (static assets only — requests routed to the SSR
# Worker by _routes.json never reach this file).
#
# @astrojs/sitemap publishes the sitemap as /sitemap-index.xml, and that is what
# robots.txt and Search Console point to. Nothing links to /sitemap.xml, but SEO
# audit tools and some crawlers probe it by convention and report the 404 as a
# broken sitemap. A permanent redirect answers them without a second sitemap.
/sitemap.xml /sitemap-index.xml 301
